OL,3,GNEWSA'Brilliant vision' scheme to be   
OL,4,A'less ambitious'                       
OL,6,FA long-stalled #200m regeneration      
OL,7,Fscheme, which a mayor once claimed     
OL,8,Fboasted "industry experts with a       
OL,9,Fbrilliant vision of what is to come",  
OL,10,Fwill now be "less ambitious" than      
OL,11,Fanticipated.                           
OL,13,FThe Crown Square project at Gresham, on
OL,14,Fa derelict plot in central             
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough, was dubbed "slapdash"   
OL,16,Fwhile being conceived in 2023.         
OL,18,FA row over alleged secrecy erupted     
OL,19,Fbefore, in July 2024, plans including a
OL,20,Fhotel, student accommodation and       
OL,21,Fapartments were revealed. They were    
OL,22,Fthen paused a year ago over cost fears.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
